      401.77,
      539.9,
      482.32
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, I, RaviKarunanayake, Minister of Finance, the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this order impose in respect of listof the commodities specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto a Special Commodity Levy, at the rates specified in thecorresponding entries in Column II of that Schedule. This Order shall be valid for a period of 06 months commencingfrom 30th September 2016, subject to provisions of Sub section (3) of Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act,No. 48 of 2007.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
